<title>USA: Oshkosh Truck Corp Q1 Dec 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh Truck Corp Q1 Dec 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  1,624		    1,572</p>
<p> Revs		     150,320		   80,383</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 fiscal 1997 operating income $6.4 million vs $2.2 million. Increase in operating income due to Pierce Manufacturing Inc, which was acquired on September 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 fiscal 1997 net interest expense $3.4 million vs net investment income of $400,000 in Q1 1996, with difference due to financing of acquisition.</p>
